      <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.18.0</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Agents can propose file transfers</b> — over SSH through the transfer
      queue, or to a serial device. Nothing moves until you press the card's
      button.</li>
  <li>Keys, <code>~/.ssh</code>, <code>~/Library</code> and other secrets on your
      Mac are never offered for upload.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
